    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dog Gone Cats: Tail of 300 Days (Pawlike Edition)",
    "steam_appid": 3419960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Levels. 30 Lives. Can You Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien cats have arrived on Earth to capture their queen, but Cosmo the dog and Stella the cat won\u2019t let them succeed! A deceptively challenging, vibrant puzzle game with a roguelike inspired element! Find all the invading alien cats hidden in the 6x6 grids\u2014but be careful! Run out of lives, and you'll be sent back to the start. Every decision counts as you push through 300 days of increasing difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level represents a day, and your goal is to survive all the way to Day 300.</strong> Don\u2019t worry\u2014your progress is saved as you complete each day, so you can take a break whenever you need to.\u00a0 However, if you\u2019ve used all your lives, your progress resets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels are procedurally generated,</strong> ensuring the traps and rewards hidden in the 6x6 grid are different every time you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Yarn Balls</strong> - Use these items to get grid hints and manage them carefully as you go through the grid!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-bit style graphics</strong> with hand-drawn vibrant sprites, sprite scaling, particle and transparency effects! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catchy soundtrack,</strong> classic style tunes with a modern synth-wave instrumentation.\u00a0 You will be humming in no time! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DLC or in-app purchases!\u00a0</strong> The only updates will be to improve the experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/828ab40d92e04d33c58c4e3e427a76b2.poster.avif?t=1748702477\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/828ab40d92e04d33c58c4e3e427a76b2.webm?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/828ab40d92e04d33c58c4e3e427a76b2.mp4?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/9d1aac05272eb51af0d1ed0825237fce.poster.avif?t=1748702477\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/9d1aac05272eb51af0d1ed0825237fce.webm?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/9d1aac05272eb51af0d1ed0825237fce.mp4?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/42646806dbf5619af65f50f0b06684de.poster.avif?t=1748702477\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/42646806dbf5619af65f50f0b06684de.webm?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/42646806dbf5619af65f50f0b06684de.mp4?t=1748702477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Levels. 30 Lives. Can You Survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien cats have arrived on Earth to capture their queen, but Cosmo the dog and Stella the cat won\u2019t let them succeed! A deceptively challenging, vibrant puzzle game with a roguelike inspired element! Find all the invading alien cats hidden in the 6x6 grids\u2014but be careful! Run out of lives, and you'll be sent back to the start. Every decision counts as you push through 300 days of increasing difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level represents a day, and your goal is to survive all the way to Day 300.</strong> Don\u2019t worry\u2014your progress is saved as you complete each day, so you can take a break whenever you need to.\u00a0 However, if you\u2019ve used all your lives, your progress resets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels are procedurally generated,</strong> ensuring the traps and rewards hidden in the 6x6 grid are different every time you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Yarn Balls</strong> - Use these items to get grid hints and manage them carefully as you go through the grid!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-bit style graphics</strong> with hand-drawn vibrant sprites, sprite scaling, particle and transparency effects! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catchy soundtrack,</strong> classic style tunes with a modern synth-wave instrumentation.\u00a0 You will be humming in no time! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DLC or in-app purchases!\u00a0</strong> The only updates will be to improve the experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419960/extras/828ab40d92e04d33c58c4e3e